["Node ex:ship must conform to one or more shapes in [ sh:property [ sh:hasValue Literal("CP") ; sh:path nltl:propellerType ] ; sh:sparql [ sh:message Literal("A CP propeller must have propeller blade load cases 1, 2, 3, and 4.") ; sh:select Literal("
